    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Dog Sit Home, at 158 rue d'Antibes in Cannes, is first and foremost a grooming salon and daycare. The address matches a "Dog Sit Home" company registered under SIREN 883 781 569 (activity "other personal services", according to societe.com) and the establishment is listed as dog and cat grooming on Pages Jaunes and Mappy. A self-service wash option has been reported, but it is not an automated station like those found elsewhere in the department, for example in Nice.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon's services include hair removal, massage and hydrotherapy. A "4 baths + full grooming" package at €100 a month is mentioned, but the price for the wash alone is not known separately. No official website was found for the salon: neither the self-service wash, nor the opening hours, nor the phone number are established by an official source.</p>
      <h2>Check before you go</h2>
      <p>Call before travelling to confirm that the salon is open, that a self-service wash option exists and on what terms: only commercial directories and the business register describe it.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: if you are only after a quick, cheap wash with no appointment, call ahead to confirm that the self-service option is actually accessible without going through the grooming package.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>Rue d'Antibes is one of the main shopping streets in central Cannes, a few minutes from the Croisette.</p>
